        "original_id": "dbd85667-494e-590f-996d-0aa35ca0ce40",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bela Lugosi\n- Works: Night Monster, Dracula (1931 film)\n- Companies: Universal Pictures Company\n- Topics: horror films\n\nFacts:\n- Bela Lugosi was born as Béla Ferenc Dezső Blaskó on 20 October 1882 and died on 16 August 1956.\n- Bela Lugosi was a Hungarian-American actor.\n- In 1931, Bela Lugosi became famous for portraying Count Dracula in the film Dracula.\n- Bela Lugosi also appeared in various other horror films.\n- Night Monster is a 1942 American black-and-white horror film.\n- Night Monster featured Bela Lugosi.\n- Universal Pictures Company produced and distributed Night Monster.",
